---
// Inline SVG sketch: glasses + ESP32-CAM -> Bluetooth -> phone -> cloud.
// No vendor product photos, per brief §5.4.
---

<figure
  class="hardware-sketch"
  aria-label="Mind's Eye hardware: glasses with an ESP32-CAM, connected over Bluetooth to a phone, which reaches cloud services"
>
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 640 160"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    role="img"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <g stroke="var(--color-evidence-500)" stroke-width="3" fill="none">
      <path
        d="M40 80 h60 a20 20 0 0 1 20 20 a20 20 0 0 1 -20 20 h-60 a20 20 0 0 1 -20 -20 a20 20 0 0 1 20 -20 z"
      ></path>
      <path
        d="M160 80 h60 a20 20 0 0 1 20 20 a20 20 0 0 1 -20 20 h-60 a20 20 0 0 1 -20 -20 a20 20 0 0 1 20 -20 z"
      ></path>
      <path d="M120 100 h40"></path>
      <circle cx="150" cy="100" r="8" fill="var(--color-ai-500)" stroke="none"
      ></circle>
    </g>
    <text
      x="130"
      y="70"
      text-anchor="middle"
      fill="var(--color-ink-200)"
      font-size="11"
      font-family="var(--font-utility)">ESP32-CAM</text
    >

    <g stroke="var(--color-ink-300)" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke-width="2">
      <path d="M240 100 h60"></path>
    </g>
    <text
      x="270"
      y="90"
      text-anchor="middle"
      fill="var(--color-ink-300)"
      font-size="10"
      font-family="var(--font-utility)">Bluetooth</text
    >

    <g stroke="var(--color-evidence-500)" stroke-width="3" fill="none">
      <rect x="310" y="55" width="60" height="90" rx="10"></rect>
      <line x1="330" y1="130" x2="350" y2="130"></line>
    </g>
    <text
      x="340"
      y="45"
      text-anchor="middle"
      fill="var(--color-ink-200)"
      font-size="11"
      font-family="var(--font-utility)">Android app</text
    >

    <g stroke="var(--color-ink-300)" stroke-width="2">
      <path d="M375 100 h60"></path>
    </g>

    <g stroke="var(--color-ai-500)" stroke-width="3" fill="none">
      <ellipse cx="500" cy="70" rx="45" ry="22"></ellipse>
      <ellipse cx="540" cy="90" rx="35" ry="18"></ellipse>
      <ellipse cx="470" cy="95" rx="30" ry="16"></ellipse>
    </g>
    <text
      x="500"
      y="130"
      text-anchor="middle"
      fill="var(--color-ink-200)"
      font-size="11"
      font-family="var(--font-utility)">Cloud + Python service</text
    >
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="visually-hidden">
    Glasses fitted with an ESP32-CAM send captures over Bluetooth to the Android
    app, which sends them on to a Python service and cloud vision services and
    speaks the result back.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .hardware-sketch {
    margin: var(--space-5) 0;
    padding: var(--space-4);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ink-900) 70%, transparent);
  }

  .hardware-sketch svg {
    display: block;
    inline-size: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
</style>
